#
# Part of RedELK
#
# In this file you can define the User Agents that are known rogue and should never hit your C2 backend.
# - One per line
# - You need to insert query wildcards yourself, e.g. "curl" will match only "curl", "*curl*" will match anything containing "curl"
# - Use *Name* for bot names embedded in browser-style User-Agent strings.
# - robots.txt-only tokens (e.g. Google-Extended, Applebot-Extended) are not HTTP User-Agents.
#
# Author: Outflank B.V. / Marc Smeets
#
# HTTP clients
curl*
python-requests*
Python-urllib*
Wget*
python-httpx*
Go-http-client*

# Social media and link preview bots
Slackbot*
Facebot
Twitterbot*
facebookexternalhit*
WhatsApp*
*SkypeUriPreview*
*Discordbot*
*TelegramBot*
*LinkedInBot*
*Pinterestbot*
*redditbot*

